<!--
  Notification small icon.

  This file did not exist, so `LocalNotifications.schedule({ smallIcon: "ic_stat_icon" })`
  threw on every Android device and the catch block swallowed it: reminders could
  never be scheduled natively. Android also requires a pure-white silhouette on a
  transparent background for status-bar icons, hence the flat #FFFFFF fill with no
  strokes. This is the Fursan mark (two squares sharing a centre) simplified for
  a 24dp canvas.
-->
